;
; A group's read marker in MYRA (hamlet_rules.h HR3): the group's place in
; the model's list (3 digits), the Lamport time of the last post the owner
; has read there (18 digits, zxvd's lamport as text) and when the marker
; moved, in seconds since 1970 (12 digits). Hamlet keeps a marker only
; when its values make a record.
^ZXHAMLET(group:i3) = lamport:i18! ^ stamp:i12!
